<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Bombard -->
  <DreamsOutposts.CommandBombard>炮击</DreamsOutposts.CommandBombard>
  <!-- EN: Fire one mortar barrage from this outpost: {0} {1} for {2}, up to {3} tiles away, with a {4} cooldown. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.CommandBombardDesc>用据点的迫击炮打一次齐射：{0}发{1}，消耗{2}，射程{3}格，冷却{4}。</DreamsOutposts.CommandBombardDesc>
  <!-- EN: Right-click this command to switch which mortar shell the outpost fires. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardSwitchHint>右键这个命令可以切换炮弹种类。</DreamsOutposts.BombardSwitchHint>
  <!-- EN: {0} ({1}) -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardShellOption>{0}（{1}）</DreamsOutposts.BombardShellOption>
  <!-- EN:  (current) -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardShellCurrentSuffix>（当前）</DreamsOutposts.BombardShellCurrentSuffix>
  <!-- EN: Requires research: {0} -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardShellLocked>需要研究：{0}</DreamsOutposts.BombardShellLocked>
  <!-- EN: The mortars of {0} now fire {1}. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardShellSwitched>{0}的迫击炮已换用{1}。</DreamsOutposts.BombardShellSwitched>
  <!-- EN: This outpost has no usable mortar shell. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardNoShells>这个据点没有可用的迫击炮弹。</DreamsOutposts.BombardNoShells>
  <!-- EN: This outpost has no facility capable of bombardment. Build a mortar emplacement first. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardNoMortar>这个据点没有可以炮击的设施，请先安装迫击炮阵地。</DreamsOutposts.BombardNoMortar>
  <!-- EN: Nobody stationed here has {0} of {1} or higher, so there is no crew for the mortars. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardNoCrew>据点里没有{0}达到{1}的人，没人能操作迫击炮。</DreamsOutposts.BombardNoCrew>
  <!-- EN: Requires someone in this outpost with {0} of {1} or higher. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.CommandBombardCrew>需要据点里有人{0} ≥ {1}。</DreamsOutposts.CommandBombardCrew>
  <!-- EN: That tile has no map, so there is nowhere for the shells to land. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardNoMapHere>这个地块上还没有地图，炮弹无处落地。</DreamsOutposts.BombardNoMapHere>
  <!-- EN: Click to enter {0} and choose where the shells land. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardClickToChoose>点击进入{0}，在地图上选择炮击位置。</DreamsOutposts.BombardClickToChoose>
  <!-- EN: The mortars are still reloading: {0} left. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardOnCooldown>迫击炮正在装填，还需{0}。</DreamsOutposts.BombardOnCooldown>
  <!-- EN: The outpost store cannot pay for this bombardment: {0}. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardNotEnoughResources>据点仓库不足以支撑这次炮击：{0}。</DreamsOutposts.BombardNotEnoughResources>
  <!-- EN: This outpost's bombardment is misconfigured (its shell has no usable projectile). Check the facility XML. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardBrokenConfig>这个据点的炮击配置有误（炮弹没有可用的弹道），请检查设施 XML。</DreamsOutposts.BombardBrokenConfig>
  <!-- EN: The mortars of {0} open fire on {1}: {2} {3} are on their way. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardLaunched>{0}的迫击炮开始炮击{1}：{2}发{3}正在落下。</DreamsOutposts.BombardLaunched>
  <!-- EN: Bombardment: {0} shells per strike, up to {1} tiles away, {2} cooldown. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardmentSummary>炮击：每次{0}发炮弹，射程{1}格，冷却{2}。</DreamsOutposts.BombardmentSummary>
  <!-- EN: Adds {0} shells to every bombardment from this outpost. -->
  <DreamsOutposts.BombardmentBonus>每次炮击额外增加{0}发炮弹。</DreamsOutposts.BombardmentBonus>
</LanguageData>
